Package: com.heavenzy.tweak
Name: Heavenzy
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Per-app device spoofer with a Ghost-style control app (model, iOS, screen, IDFV/IDFA/UDID/serial, carrier, time zone, locale) plus a wipe + re-spoof that clears saved accounts and blocks iCloud restore. Configure apps in the Heavenzy app, or use the in-app panel via a two-finger long-press.
Maintainer: Heavenzy
Author: Heavenzy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, libsandy
